# The build context of every Python service is the repository root, because a
# service depends on packages/ by path and a narrower context cannot see them.
# Everything a build does not need is excluded here rather than copied and then
# ignored: a stray host virtualenv is built for another platform, and the mock
# corpus is data that belongs in a volume, never inside an image.

.git
.gitignore
.worktrees

**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache

**/node_modules
apps/web/dist

artifacts
docs
tests
migrations
scripts

.env
.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
